*1 [[Zomboe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zollow]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*3 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Miss Haka]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Techn-Old Hyena]] spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
