**Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Deathshund]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.

